achne' dear, don't be rude.\\. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm not some common house spider."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["So, do you want to fight or not?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I want to see just how strong the "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["person who managed to get past all"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["my little minions is.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 301, "parameters": [0, 5, false, true]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 601, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Gah!\\. I feel I may have misjudged you "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["human\\..\\..\\..No matter.\\. I yield, your precious "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["little bees can have their forest back, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I was getting bored of it anyway.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I doubt this will be the last time we "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["meet though human. When that time does "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["come though, I hope you're ready for a "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["proper fight.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 212, "parameters": [0, 110, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [20]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 123, "parameters": ["A", 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well that was.\\..\\..strange."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": [""]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I guess I should go and tell that bee "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["queen that I got rid of the spider lady."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 122, "parameters": [22, 22, 0, 0, 4]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 603, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Pity, I was hoping you would be at least "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["a little stronger than that.\\. No matter.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The real question is,\\. what to do with "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you now.\\..\\.."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Ooh, I know. I'll give you a reward for "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["getting this far,\\. you'll make a good "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["second in command.\\..\\..I needed a new one "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["anyway."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 8, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-1", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hey, I'm here too! What about me?"]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I don't care about you. You can leave."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-1", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Wow, rude. I'm not leaving \\n[1] "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["alone."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fine, I'll find somewhere for you."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 18, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Alaru Faceset", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["And what of me?"]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I don't care about you. You can leave."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Alaru Faceset", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hmph, I will not leave his fate to your "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hand."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Fine, I'll find somewhere for you."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 223, "parameters": [[-255, -255, -255, 0], 120, true]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["As your vision fades to black the last thing you see "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["is Arachne leaning over your fallen body and "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["dragging you out of the room."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": [""]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["By the time you wake up, your body has already "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["changed."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [60]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Hornet01", 0, 0, -10, 0, 58, 58, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 222, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 1, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Do you like it?\\. I had a potion whipped up"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["especially for you, we can't have my"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["second in command looking like a normal "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hornet now, can we?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You bow before your mistress and utter a quick"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["'thank you' before beginning to examine your"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["new body."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 1, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I also made it so you can never question my"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["orders, we wouldn't want you getting any "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["ideas now, would we. We certainly don't "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["want you ending up like the last girl!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 8, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I ran a little test on your friend. "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Let's just say he's in for a rough "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["life...\\.I'd prefer not to think about it."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [4, 18, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Actor4-8", 3, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I ran a little test on your friend. "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Let's just say she's in for a rough "]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 401, "parameters": ["life...\\.I'd prefer not to think about it."]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["With your skill and expertise you quickly manage to "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["completely subjugate the honeybees and as a result "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["take over the entire forest. "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["", 0, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Eventually your mistress gets bored with the whole "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "pa